&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we empower small businesses with simple, affordable tools to start, run, and grow. Our &lt;strong&gt;Global Bank teams&lt;/strong&gt; build the financial services that help merchants manage their money and keep their businesses moving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For merchants, a transfer should feel simple. Behind that experience is a complex network of payment schemes, banks, providers, messages, certificates, reconciliations, and edge cases—all of which need to work together reliably.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transfers Europe squad&lt;/strong&gt; is the integration layer connecting SumUp’s internal systems with the financial networks that move money across Europe and the UK. We build and run the backend services behind SEPA and UK transfer flows, helping move money accurately and reliably across external networks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Backend Engineer,&lt;/strong&gt; you’ll take ownership of services that process real money. You’ll work on complex systems problems to ensure seamless integrations as we scale, while seeing a direct connection between your engineering decisions and merchant trust.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you enjoy understanding how systems behave under real-world conditions while improving them over time, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our tech stack &lt;/strong&gt;includes Golang, AWS, Kafka, PostgreSQL, Redis and Kubernetes, supported by a strong observability toolchain with Prometheus, Grafana, and Honeycomb. We also actively use AI‑assisted development tools such as Cursor, GitHub Copilot, and others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain &lt;strong&gt;production money movement backend services&lt;/strong&gt;, contributing to their delivery, observability, and ongoing maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Wolt, keeping courier supply healthy across every city we operate in is core to a great experience for both customers and couriers. As we&#39;ve scaled to dozens of countries and hundreds of cities, planning &amp;amp; managing supply has grown from a market-by-market exercise into a global challenge: we need a system that plans well everywhere at once, from our largest metros to our smallest cities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s where this role comes in. As Senior Specialist, Global Market Planning, you&#39;ll help refine the models and tools at the heart of how we plan courier supply globally. You&#39;ll make sure the right supply levers are pulled in the right markets, and you&#39;ll help us learn which levers actually work. It&#39;s a role at the crossroads of data, tooling, and operations. It&#39;s for someone who is as comfortable designing a test or building a model as they are working out why a specific market is off pla

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lunar Sales:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Celonis Lunar Sales is a fast-track, 2-year development programme designed for ambitious professionals who want to accelerate their career at the intersection of AI, enterprise technology, and strategic sales.&amp;nbsp; If you have experience solving complex problems in a client-facing role, in management or strategy consulting or a leading industry strategy function and you are ready to bring that expertise into enterprise sales, this is your launchpad.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Program immerses you in every stage of the customer sales journey, supported by motivating leaders who will help accelerate your growth beyond expectations. If you&#39;re an innovative thinker who thrives on overcoming challenges, our Top Talent Sales Program will provide strategic significance, arming you with the knowledge and tools to address complex problems, create meaningful change and excel as an Account Executive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
